\n        \n              has-aspect-ratio\n            \" style=\"\n                position: relative;\n                \n                  padding-bottom:129.36399841308594%;\n                \n                overflow: hidden;-webkit-mask-image: -webkit-radial-gradient(white, black);\n              \"\n              >\n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img data-stretch=\"false\" data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/8e736144-54d7-4844-bc60-bedd0764c59c/Screen+Shot+2023-06-09+at+2.14.09+PM.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/8e736144-54d7-4844-bc60-bedd0764c59c/Screen+Shot+2023-06-09+at+2.14.09+PM.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"739x956\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"\" data-load=\"false\" elementtiming=\"system-image-block\" data-sqsp-image-classic-block-image src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/8e736144-54d7-4844-bc60-bedd0764c59c/Screen+Shot+2023-06-09+at+2.14.09+PM.jpg\" width=\"739\" height=\"956\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 100vw, 100vw\" style=\"display:block;object-fit: cover; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-position: 50% 50%\" onload=\"this.classList.add(&quot;loaded&quot;)\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/8e736144-54d7-4844-bc60-bedd0764c59c/Screen+Shot+2023-06-09+at+2.14.09+PM.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/8e736144-54d7-4844-bc60-bedd0764c59c/Screen+Shot+2023-06-09+at+2.14.09+PM.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/8e736144-54d7-4844-bc60-bedd0764c59c/Screen+Shot+2023-06-09+at+2.14.09+PM.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/8e736144-54d7-4844-bc60-bedd0764c59c/Screen+Shot+2023-06-09+at+2.14.09+PM.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/8e736144-54d7-4844-bc60-bedd0764c59c/Screen+Shot+2023-06-09+at+2.14.09+PM.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/8e736144-54d7-4844-bc60-bedd0764c59c/Screen+Shot+2023-06-09+at+2.14.09+PM.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/8e736144-54d7-4844-bc60-bedd0764c59c/Screen+Shot+2023-06-09+at+2.14.09+PM.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-loader=\"sqs\">\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    </div>\n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-spacer spacer-block sized vsize-1\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/0263b71b-ac4c-4387-99c6-73a2da637133_1112/website.components.spacer.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/0263b71b-ac4c-4387-99c6-73a2da637133_1112/website.components.spacer.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.spacer\" data-website-component-id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1686333821209_26036\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1686333821209_26036\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">&nbsp;</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/a9032d95-ba0b-473e-a531-82cdd71f9f84_789/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/a9032d95-ba0b-473e-a531-82cdd71f9f84_789/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"de73df9616edc6fb842b\" id=\"block-de73df9616edc6fb842b\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Name of the Father</h4><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The pond from my memory wrote a name<br>on a slip of paper and pinned it to a tree<br>I always pass in the morning.<br><br>The name is my father’s and for some reason<br>it always brings back the memory<br>of burning my leg on the exhaust<br>of a tractor. He poured water over me<br>and the seared flesh rose as if extra limbs<br>were trying to tear their way out.<br><br>This isn’t even my memory.<br>I don’t know whose it is.<br><br>One time I noticed that the ink<br>on the note had faded completely<br>and when I turned at the tree,<br>my skin went one way<br>and I went the other.</p><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">What We Were Trying to Do All Along</h4><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Available now in <a href=\"https://bottlecap.press/products/collision\">A Collision of Soul in Midair</a></p><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Composing a Soundtrack</h4><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A book containing your heartbeat goes out<br>without a coat, and comes back shivering<br>and water-stained.<br><br>A man with a birdcage<br>for a head had sung into the pages&nbsp;<br>and pulled at his metal strands like a harp.<br><br>Taking this as encouragement,<br>the heartbeat made a film about<br>birds with cages as heads.<br><br>The camera does pneumonia shakes<br>and inside the cages are birdcages<br>with men as heads. And inside them,<br><br>well, it is difficult to tell how far this goes.<br>You came into the book to watch a private screening.<br>The only things that moved were the names<br><br>with bird nests in their letters. In between sound,<br>your heartbeat clasps your shoulder<br>and asks what you think.</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-de73df9616edc6fb842b {\n    \n    \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-de73df9616edc6fb842b .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-de73df9616edc6fb842b {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-de73df9616edc6fb842b {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-de73df9616edc6fb842b {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-de73df9616edc6fb842b {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-de73df9616edc6fb842b .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n    \n  </style>\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>",
  "excerpt": "We were working with a botched biopsy / of the twentieth century, so who could blame us? / My mother was the year of the horse; / she cradled me in her days and cut / my umbilical cord with the teeth of December"
}
